        <zone fixed-size='241' forceUpdate='true' h='5067' id='28' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='75583' x='9417' y='867'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='15'>Insights View</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>We&apos;ve used a combination of the weightage (%) and Availability to create a prioritised order of regions, countries,stores,categories &amp; SKUs. Focusing on the top items in each dimension will drive the largest improvement to the KPI</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
